  "description": "*\"I'm different from that person, too different!\"* \n\nCheong-Uk and Un-Ho have been living together for three months due to unavoidable circumstances. The two people who don't match at all end up clashing and fighting over trivial things. Their anger towards each other builds up and before they know it, they're on the verge of exploding, but Un-Ho ends up revealing his secret to Cheong-Uk...! \n\nWill Cheong-Uk and Un-Ho be able to get along without any problems in the future?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes 12 extra chapters.*",
